      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Old Way:\n\nFetch\n\n- Write a function that calls fetch(api)\n- Async\n- Await the fetch resolution\n- usually call setState -> updates the local state\n- react rerenders with the new data",
