    {
      "id": "lxVnpLGxPNaTYqO8UKgxy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1577.9404602050781,
      "y": 871.5038517801851,
      "width": 798.239501953125,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 715373712,
      "version": 496,
      "versionNonce": 2013567088,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789569222235,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Define fetcher functions\n- Map those functions to keys in a store\n- Create hooks that utilize the fetcher functions to update the store as needed\n\n- Caching (with controllable staleness times)\n- auto-fetching when data is needed\n- manually invalidate the cache\n- global state\n- prefetch things\n- loading and error states\n- lots of other goodies\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Define fetcher functions\n- Map those functions to keys in a store\n- Create hooks that utilize the fetcher functions to update the store as needed\n\n- Caching (with controllable staleness times)\n- auto-fetching when data is needed\n- manually invalidate the cache\n- global state\n- prefetch things\n- loading and error states\n- lots of other goodies\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
